      "countAsCompletedLeaf": true,
      "exactBehavior": "Add opens the actual staged namespace grouping Enter Text child with raw namespace default and exact apply/cancel buttons. Blank is valid; colon, whitespace, case, nested colons, hyphens, Unicode and duplicate entries are preserved without tag cleanup or deduplication. Blank/colon rows render as unnamespaced/namespaced. Add appends without changing queue selection. Parent Apply is blocked while the exact child owns input, Cancel discards the draft, Apply saves raw order and reopen restores it. Existing sidebar/viewer user-group sort consumes the saved first-match order; six actual Qt sort orders are replayed. Concurrent unrelated sort/display/connector fields survive save. Hidden, stale, rebound and accepted-close owners cannot stage or save retained callbacks. Stacked native sort/group dropdowns now receive intrinsic row height. Authored real-frame checks cover four contexts with initial and saved/reopened values at900x640 and1000x850, within-row containment, strict dropdown/row separation, namespace heading clearance and actual narrow-view scrolling. Actual blank-valid Add and populated Edit captures complement the original raw-default Add and saved queue frames without changing transactions.",
